SUMMARY:Monthly Peace Meditation
DESCRIPTION:Since 1986\, a group of committed people have been meeting on the last calendar day of every month to pray and meditate together with a focus on world peace. All are welcome. \nFor more information\, please contact Vivian Strand\, RScP\, at (707) 953-1917. \nThe Zoom link is https://tinyurl.com/CSLPeaceMed
